            <ArticleTitle>Perioperative stroke: evaluation, management, and possible preventive measures.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>230-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Mechanisms of perioperative ischemic stroke include: hypotension, hypercoagulability, arrhythmias with embolism, or direct vascular insult. Mechanisms of perioperative hemorrhagic stroke include: use of antithrombotics, hypertension, or direct vascular insult.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
